    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "Following a period of internal review, the chief executive communicated a direct announcement of planned job eliminations at the tax-software company. This corporate announcement detailed a significant workforce reduction, with affected employees offered a severance package that includes 16 weeks of base pay plus two weeks per year of tenure. The restructuring aims to co-locate teams in strategic hubs to accelerate AI-driven product work, representing a deliberate organizational change toward greater efficiency and innovation in a competitive landscape.",
