    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The company undertaking workforce restructuring has presented a rationale based on months of internal assessment. Key outcomes include the elimination of approximately 3,000 full-time roles and the winding down of offices in Reno and Woodland Hills as part of the consolidation of physical locations. Financial terms provided to affected employees feature a tenure-based formula for compensation, an effort to manage the transition during this major headcount decrease across the organization.",
